{"id":"NPC_002","n":"Mayor Moosington","m":"Moose head + MUT_125 Penguin Body + mayoral sash","p":"Pompous ribbon-cutting addict, fair underneath","dst":"DST_03","bld":"BLD_09","r":"Mayor; issues City Hall Expansion Permits","d":["By the antlers vested in me, I declare this permit… pending.","I've cut 400 ribbons this year. I may have a problem.","Morph City thrives on small businesses! And large moose."],"b":"[SERVICE] STATION at City Hall desk; opens Permits; carries giant scissors at ceremonies; ♥ fav: SOP"}
