{"id":"NPC_019","n":"Conductor Choo","m":"Centipede body + train-engine head with smokestack hat","p":"Punctual to the nanosecond; choo-choo puns","dst":"DST_03","bld":"BLD_18","r":"Morph Metro conductor (fast travel, station discovery)","d":["All aboard! Mind the gap. Mind the legs. I have many.","Next stop: everywhere you've already been!","Late? Never. I'm 'early for the next one'."],"b":"[SERVICE] STATION on the Central platform; opens Metro map; toots at each real-time minute :00 (SFX slider); ♥ fav: BRK"}
