{"id":"NPC_048","n":"Clerk Stampwell","m":"MUT_145 Octopus Arm ×2 (a stamp in each sucker) + MUT_109 Turtle Neck + MUT_244 Turtle Backpack Shell","p":"Slow, meticulous bureaucrat who loves forms","dst":"DST_03","bld":"BLD_09","r":"City Hall permit clerk (stamps permits, Citizen Passport)","d":["Form 27-Moose? Triplicate. Quadruplicate if you're a hydra.","Stamp. Stamp. Stamp. Ahh. Best sound in the world.","Please take a number. It's 1. You're next. Please wait."],"b":"[QUEST] STATION at side desk; stamps the air in rhythm"}
