{"id":"NPC_052","n":"Commuter Carl","m":"MUT_186 Cheetah Leg ×2 + MUT_012 Wolf Head + briefcase","p":"Frazzled; always late despite cheetah legs","dst":"DST_03","bld":"BLD_18","at":"Metro carriages","r":"Metro rider; speed-cooking challenge giver","d":["Cheetah legs, and I STILL miss the train.","Breakfast in four minutes or I'm doomed!","Running is easy. Stopping is the hard part."],"b":"[QUEST] RIDE the Metro loop; talkable when his carriage docks at Central; sprints platforms at Dawn"}
