{"id":"NPC_056","n":"Officer Biscuit","m":"MUT_003 Dog Head + MUT_212 Dog Tail + MUT_117 Plain Human Torso; whistle","p":"Overeager rookie, tail always wagging","dst":"DST_03","at":"Downtown plaza","r":"Rookie security officer (de-escalation dailies)","d":["Sergeant Rhonda says I'm a good boy. Officer! Good OFFICER!","Calm Down! works on customers. Not on squirrels. I tried.","Is that a tantrum? I'm on it! Wait for me!"],"b":"[QUEST] PATROL a few steps behind Sergeant Rhonda"}
