{"id":"NPC_063","n":"Kate Crate","m":"MUT_024 Gorilla Head + MUT_148 Gorilla Arm ×2 + cardboard-box helmet","p":"Strong, blunt, fond of rubble","dst":"DST_04","bld":"BLD_15","at":"crate stacks","r":"Crate stacker; rebuild challenges","d":["Rubble's just furniture taking a break.","I stack crates. Crates stack me. It's a relationship.","Destroyed? Nothing's ever destroyed. Just rearranged."],"b":"[QUEST] STATION at crate stack; restacks fallen crates"}
{"id":"NPC_064","n":"Sir Squeaks-a-Lot","m":"MUT_022 Robot Head + MUT_192 Unicycle Wheel Leg + MUT_155 Magnet Hand Arm","p":"Excessively polite robot who squeaks every step","dst":"DST_04","at":"Industrial roads","r":"Oil-can courier robot; ally during EVT_017","d":["Pardon me. Excuse me. Terribly sorry. Squeak.","My fellow robots are rising up. Politely. Please calm them gently.","Might I trouble you for a drop of oil? Squeeeak."],"b":"[QUEST] PATROL roads; bows to every player; ♥ fav: DRK"}
{"id":"NPC_065","n":"Mildred Mopsworth","m":"MUT_066 Vacuum Mouth + MUT_260 Sheep Wool + MUT_202 Bunny Slippers; reading glasses","p":"Retired cleaner; sweet but spotless standards","dst":"DST_04","bld":"BLD_15","at":"Lost & Found window","r":"Retiree; Lost & Found keeper; cleanliness challenges","d":["Back in my day we cleaned with our mouths. Vacuum mouths. Different times.","Pristine, dear. Not 'pretty clean'. PRISTINE.","Found: one left shoe, three tentacles, a dream."],"b":"[QUEST] SIT at Lost & Found; hoovers crumbs off players who linger; ♥ fav: DES"}
