{"id":"NPC_066","n":"Mall Cop Mallomar","m":"MUT_009 Fish Head + MUT_129 Pufferfish Body + MUT_204 Roller Skates; tiny hat","p":"Jumpy guard who puffs up when startled","dst":"DST_05","bld":"BLD_12","r":"Mall security (bouncer dailies)","d":["Halt! Oh no, I'm puffing. Give me a second.","No running in the mall! Roller skating is fine.","I've seen things. Food-court things."],"b":"[QUEST] PATROL concourse; puffs up when a player jumps beside him"}
{"id":"NPC_067","n":"Speedwalk Gladys","m":"MUT_013 Deer Head + MUT_260 Sheep Wool + MUT_188 Ostrich Leg ×2; sweatband","p":"Fiercely fit retiree mall-walker","dst":"DST_05","bld":"BLD_12","r":"Retiree; Grandma Golem service dailies","d":["Ten laps before lunch! Eleven if there's pie.","You young mutants and your 'sprinting'. Walk with PURPOSE.","Treat grandmas right and they'll tell you stories. Long ones."],"b":"[QUEST] PATROL the mall loop fast; overtakes running players; ♥ fav: DES"}
{"id":"NPC_068","n":"Kiosk Kevin","m":"MUT_103 Antenna Bobbles + MUT_068 Megaphone Mouth + MUT_117 Plain Human Torso","p":"Pushy but harmless salesman","dst":"DST_05","bld":"BLD_12","at":"antenna-case kiosk","r":"Kiosk vendor; social & photo weeklies","d":["Antenna case? Protect those bobbles!","Photo mode is FREE. Antenna cases are not.","Wanna go viral? Stand here. Wave. Boom, viral."],"b":"[QUEST] STATION at kiosk; megaphone-greets anyone within 12 studs (SFX slider)"}
