{"id":"NPC_070","n":"Duchess Decora","m":"MUT_101 Unicorn Horn + MUT_241 Fairy Wings + MUT_272 Sparkle Aura","p":"Lavish sparkle-maximalist decorator","dst":"DST_05","bld":"BLD_12","at":"Décor Boutique","r":"Decoration boutique owner; parade-float quests","d":["More sparkle. No, MORE. There's no such thing as too much sparkle.","A restaurant without a chandelier is a kitchen with chairs.","Floats are just furniture that parades."],"b":"[QUEST] STATION in boutique; glitter puff on every purchase (reduced-FX safe)"}
{"id":"NPC_071","n":"Corndog Cornelius","m":"Corn-dog head + MUT_143 Noodle Arm ×2 + MUT_121 Chicken Body","p":"Competitive but fair food-court rival","dst":"DST_05","bld":"BLD_12","at":"food court stall","r":"Food-court stall owner (rival vendor)","d":["My corn dogs are battered with SUCCESS.","The Baron opened a kiosk here. A KIOSK. In MY food court.","Noodle arms: perfect for long-distance dunking."],"b":"[QUEST] STATION at stall flipping pretend corn dogs"}
{"id":"NPC_072","n":"Escalator Ed","m":"MUT_113 Spring Neck + MUT_208 Spring Boots + MUT_117 Plain Human Torso","p":"Bouncy escalator enthusiast; Mallory's cousin","dst":"DST_05","bld":"BLD_12","r":"Mall regular who rides the escalators all day","d":["Up! Down! Up! This is the life.","Cousin Mallory says I'm 'bad for business'. I'm GREAT for escalators.","Boing. That's my neck saying hi."],"b":"[AMBIENT] PATROL the escalators endlessly; bounces at the top"}
