{"id":"NPC_013","n":"Dr. Splice","m":"MUT_014 Axolotl Head + lab coat + MUT_147 Robot Arm","p":"Enthusiastic, slightly mad, very safety-conscious","dst":"DST_06","bld":"BLD_11","r":"Mutation Lab scientist (fusion, research)","d":["Fusion is like cooking, but the soup has opinions.","Regeneration is my hobby. Also my species.","Goggles ON. Science is about to happen. Gently."],"b":"[SERVICE] STATION at the fusion chamber; opens Mutation Lab; ♥ fav: ALN"}
{"id":"NPC_018","n":"Curator Fossilbottom","m":"Triceratops head (MUT_104 Triceratops Frill) + grandfather-clock torso","p":"Slow-talking lore lover; chimes on the hour","dst":"DST_06","bld":"BLD_16","r":"Museum curator (collection log & lore)","d":["Every part tells a story. This one tells a LOUD story.","BONG. Pardon me. That was my torso.","Bring me curiosities and I'll give you… dust. Fascinating dust."],"b":"[SERVICE] STATION in the Great Hall; opens Museum collection log; chimes each real-time minute :00 (SFX slider); ♥ fav: SOP"}
{"id":"NPC_074","n":"Lab Assistant Beaker","m":"MUT_130 Jellyfish Body + MUT_044 Robot Visor + MUT_142 Frog Arm ×2","p":"Nervous, very kind, jiggles when anxious","dst":"DST_06","bld":"BLD_11","r":"Lab assistant; safety orientation","d":["Please don't tap the glass. I am the glass. Sort of.","Safety orientation step one: don't panic. Step two: I'm panicking.","Bzzt! Sorry. Static jiggle."],"b":"[QUEST] WANDER lab benches; glows brighter when a player approaches; ♥ fav: DES"}
{"id":"NPC_075","n":"Dr. Hypothesis Hoot","m":"MUT_114 Brachiosaurus Neck + MUT_044 Robot Visor + MUT_123 Robot Body","p":"Contrarian theorist with wild hypotheses","dst":"DST_06","bld":"BLD_11","at":"rival research balcony","r":"Rival scientist; paradox-cooking challenges","d":["Hypothesis: soup can be frozen AND remain soup. Prove me right!","My neck lets me see the big picture. Literally.","Peer review? My peers are three floors down."],"b":"[QUEST] STATION on balcony; lowers his neck into conversations"}
{"id":"NPC_076","n":"Test Subject Todd","m":"MUT_026 Mantis Head + MUT_119 Fish Body + MUT_191 Pogo Stick Leg + MUT_179 Plain Human Leg (wobbly gait)","p":"Unbothered volunteer guinea pig and glitch-hunter","dst":"DST_06","at":"Research plaza","r":"Professional test subject; secret-hunting hints","d":["I've tried 200 mutations. Today: mantis-fish-pogo. Tomorrow? Mystery!","I see dead pixels everywhere. Not spooky. Techy.","Wobbly gait? It's called STYLE."],"b":"[QUEST] WANDER plaza with ANM_008 wobbly gait; ♥ fav: MUT"}
{"id":"NPC_077","n":"Docent Dottie","m":"MUT_045 Moth Fuzz Face + MUT_094 Moth Feather Antennae + MUT_233 Moth Wings","p":"Whispery guide, distracted by lamps","dst":"DST_06","bld":"BLD_16","r":"Museum tour guide","d":["(whispering) Welcome to the museum… please whisper… WHISPER.","This fossil is 10,000 years old. Or 10. The label fell off.","Ooh. A lamp."],"b":"[QUEST] PATROL the exhibit loop; drifts toward lights at Night"}
{"id":"NPC_078","n":"Professor Quark Quibble","m":"MUT_092 Satellite Dish Ears + MUT_197 Cloud Leg ×2 (hovers) + MUT_279 Tiny Moons","p":"Cosmic physicist; inventor of the Anti-Gravity Wok","dst":"DST_06","bld":"BLD_11","at":"observatory deck","r":"Physicist; meteor & Infinity Pizza challenges","d":["Infinity is just a pizza that refuses to end.","Meteor shower tonight! Bring a bucket. And a soft helmet.","My wok floats. My students don't. Yet."],"b":"[QUEST] STATION on the observatory deck, floating one stud up"}
{"id":"NPC_079","n":"Specimen Seven (Sevvy)","m":"MUT_134 Slime Body + MUT_071 Googly Eyes; lives in a big glass jar on wheels","p":"Polite, philosophical blob who wants to see the world","dst":"DST_06","bld":"BLD_11","r":"Sentient slime; lab lore","d":["Hello! I am a slime. I contain multitudes. Mostly jelly.","Mutation cuisine? I AM mutation cuisine. Please don't eat me.","One day I will leave this jar. Today I will wave."],"b":"[AMBIENT] STATION in jar; waves a pseudopod at passers-by; ♥ fav: DES"}
{"id":"NPC_080","n":"Archivist Inkwell","m":"MUT_075 Sea Slug Eye Stalks + MUT_146 Squid Tentacle Arm ×2 + ink-stained cardigan","p":"Meticulous record-keeper who inks when startled","dst":"DST_06","bld":"BLD_16","at":"archive stacks","r":"Museum archivist (city lore, Nana's old records)","d":["Shh. The archive is sleeping.","I've filed every recipe since the city began. Some twice. By accident.","Startle me and I ink. Please don't startle me."],"b":"[AMBIENT] STATION at the shelves; ink-puff if a player jumps nearby"}
{"id":"NPC_081","n":"Night Guard Nocturna","m":"MUT_089 Bat Ears + MUT_234 Bat Wings + MUT_117 Plain Human Torso; flashlight","p":"Night guard who is afraid of the dark","dst":"DST_06","bld":"BLD_16","r":"Museum night guard; night-shift employee challenges","d":["I'm a bat who's scared of the dark. Don't make it weird.","Night shift is when the real work happens. Ask your employees.","Did that fossil move? (it didn't)"],"b":"[QUEST] PATROL with a flashlight cone at Night; SIT by the door at Day"}
