{"id":"NPC_085","n":"Chuckles McGuffaw","m":"MUT_051 Clown Nose + MUT_068 Megaphone Mouth + MUT_202 Bunny Slippers","p":"Pun-addicted comedian who laughs at his own jokes","dst":"DST_07","at":"Giggle Grotto comedy club","r":"Stand-up comic; time-loop breakfast challenge","d":["Why did the burger go to school? To be well-bred! …I'll see myself out.","Breakfast for dinner for breakfast? That's my whole schedule!","I'm only funny when I'm hungry. So: always."],"b":"[QUEST] PERFORM at the club door; laugh-track SFX when a player emotes"}
