{"id":"NPC_025","n":"Old Man Pigeon","m":"MUT_004 Pigeon Head + MUT_124 Muscle Torso + MUT_235 Pigeon Wings","p":"Gossip who flexes constantly and knows everything","dst":"DST_08","bld":"BLD_19","r":"Park regular; gossip, tips and story intel","d":["Back in my day, burgers had ONE patty and we LIKED it.","Coo. I've heard things. Rat things. Crown things.","Want a tip? Never trust a shark in a monocle."],"b":"[STORY] SIT on the park bench; flexes at joggers; feeds crowd pigeons at Dawn; ♥ fav: BRG"}
