{"id":"NPC_092","n":"Pipsqueak Polly","m":"MUT_231 Tiny Chicken Wings + MUT_180 Chicken Leg ×2 + MUT_085 Bunny Ears","p":"Determined kid who wants to fly","dst":"DST_08","bld":"BLD_19","r":"Kid; travel & sky exploration","d":["One day these wings will lift me! (flap flap) …One day.","Did you ride a Pigeon Taxi? What was it LIKE?","I'm not short. I'm aerodynamically compact."],"b":"[QUEST] WANDER the park; flaps and hops every 30 s; ♥ fav: DES"}
