{"id":"NPC_098","n":"Lemonade Lulu","m":"MUT_002 Cat Head + MUT_142 Frog Arm ×2 + MUT_211 Cat Tail","p":"Fierce kid entrepreneur","dst":"DST_08","at":"lemonade stand near BLD_19","r":"Kid; drink dailies","d":["Lemonade! One MB! Two if you want a cup.","My business plan: lemons. That's the whole plan.","Your drinks are good. Mine are better. We can still be friends."],"b":"[QUEST] STATION at her stand selling pretend lemonade to crowd NPCs; ♥ fav: DRK"}
