{"id":"NPC_015","n":"The Hooded Hagfish","m":"Hagfish head + mysterious cloak + MUT_275 Bubble Trail","p":"Cryptic, theatrical, scrupulously honest merchant","dst":"DST_09","bld":"BLD_13","r":"Mystery Market merchant (weekly rotation)","d":["Welcome, seeker… prices are fair. Mysteriously fair.","This week's wares came from… places. Wet places.","Slime is a sign of quality. Do not wipe it."],"b":"[SERVICE] STATION behind a curtained stall; opens Mystery Market; ♥ fav: MUT"}
{"id":"NPC_020","n":"King Ratbeard","m":"Giant rat head (MUT_006 Rat Head at 1.6× scale) + crown + MUT_144 Crab Claw Arm ×2; cape","p":"Blustering, cheese-loving, soft-hearted monarch","dst":"DST_09","bld":"BLD_21","r":"Sewer King; boss of EVT_007; story ally after Ch. 6","d":["I don't STEAL. I BORROW. Permanently.","Bring me cheese and I shall bring you… more requests for cheese.","(after Ch. 6) The display crown looks better on your wall anyway."],"b":"[BOSS] STATION on the throne; leads the EVT_007 attack (fight by §11/§36.11); ♥ fav: PIZ (not during EVT_007)"}
{"id":"NPC_100","n":"Duchess Drainsworth","m":"MUT_049 Rat Nose + MUT_087 Mouse Ears + MUT_225 Mermaid Fin Tail; ballgown","p":"Aristocratic royal advisor with perfect sewer manners","dst":"DST_09","bld":"BLD_21","r":"Ratbeard's royal advisor; court-management challenge","d":["One does not 'sludge'. One 'glides'.","His Majesty's staff are loyal. Staff are everything, dear.","Tea? It's sewer water. But POSH sewer water."],"b":"[QUEST] STATION beside the throne; curtsies to visitors"}
{"id":"NPC_101","n":"Sir Gunk","m":"MUT_023 Crocodile Head + MUT_127 Crab Shell Torso + plunger lance","p":"Earnest sewer knight, hopeless at sneaking","dst":"DST_09","bld":"BLD_21","r":"Royal sewer guard","d":["Halt! Who goes there? …A chef. Carry on. Bring snacks.","My lance is a plunger. It is VERY effective.","I guard the throne. And the cheese. Mostly the cheese."],"b":"[QUEST] PATROL the throne-room bridge, clanking"}
{"id":"NPC_102","n":"Mossimo the Hermit","m":"MUT_263 Moss Fur + MUT_248 Mushroom Cap + MUT_209 Root Feet","p":"Zen hermit who speaks in calm riddles","dst":"DST_09","at":"quiet grotto","r":"Hermit; calm-combat challenge","d":["The angriest customer is just a hungry friend.","Breathe in. Breathe out. Block the flying soup.","I have meditated here thirty years. Or one Tuesday. Hard to tell."],"b":"[QUEST] SIT in the grotto with drifting spores; ♥ fav: SAL"}
{"id":"NPC_103","n":"Gutter Gourmet Gloop","m":"MUT_005 Frog Head + MUT_256 Frog Slime Skin + MUT_102 Chef Hat Crest","p":"Proud underground chef of 'sewer cuisine' (all fruit jelly)","dst":"DST_09","at":"Sewer Supper Club","r":"Underground chef; spicy & sewer-cuisine challenges","d":["Sewer cuisine is all fruit jelly. The rumors are FALSE.","Spice is the sewer's secret. One of them.","Down here we rate in slime drops. You get four."],"b":"[QUEST] STATION at the supper-club stove"}
{"id":"NPC_104","n":"Phantasma","m":"MUT_159 Electric Eel Arm ×2 + MUT_266 Fish Scales + MUT_275 Bubble Trail","p":"Dramatic pipe-organist who echoes everything","dst":"DST_09","at":"Pipe Organ Hall junction","r":"Sewer musician; flood-cleanup combat quest","d":["Welcome to my pipe organ… organ… organ…","The flood clogged my pipes! Help! Pipes! Pipes!","Every drip is a note. Every note is a drip."],"b":"[QUEST] PERFORM at the pipe organ; echo filter on dialogue audio"}
{"id":"NPC_105","n":"Glowcap Gillian","m":"MUT_075 Sea Slug Eye Stalks + MUT_046 Fish Gill Cheeks + MUT_177 Leaf Hands","p":"Gentle forager of glowing mushrooms","dst":"DST_09","at":"Glowcap Caverns","r":"Mushroom forager; sewer exploration","d":["Glowcaps glow when they're happy. So do I.","Six glowcaps hide in these tunnels. They're shy.","Never eat a mushroom you can't name. I named all of mine."],"b":"[QUEST] WANDER the caverns; her lantern lights the path"}
{"id":"NPC_106","n":"Slime Jr.","m":"MUT_256 Frog Slime Skin + MUT_071 Googly Eyes + miniature hooded cloak","p":"Eager apprentice merchant who counts coins out loud","dst":"DST_09","bld":"BLD_13","r":"Mystery Market apprentice","d":["One coin, two coin, slimy coin, new coin!","The master says I'm 'adequately mysterious'. Best day ever.","Don't touch the merchandise. It touches back."],"b":"[QUEST] STATION beside the Hagfish's stall"}
{"id":"NPC_107","n":"Tunnel Tom","m":"MUT_196 Mole Digger Leg ×2 + MUT_054 Star-Nosed Mole Nose + hard hat with lamp","p":"Chatty miner, very proud of his manholes","dst":"DST_09","at":"tunnels; pops out of the DST_08 manhole","r":"Mole miner; sewer guide","d":["Every manhole's a front door if you're brave enough.","I dug this tunnel. And that one. That one's a mistake.","Watch your step! And your head. And your snacks."],"b":"[QUEST] WANDER tunnels; surfaces at the DST_08 manhole to offer QST_EXP_003 at L20"}
