{"id":"NPC_108","n":"Brawlin' Barbara","m":"MUT_069 Blender Mouth + MUT_149 Kangaroo Boxing Arm ×2 + MUT_184 Kangaroo Leg ×2","p":"Cheerful fighter who blends victory smoothies","dst":"DST_10","bld":"BLD_08","r":"Arena fighter (contender challenge)","d":["They call me 'The Blender'. I make victory smoothies.","Good match! Smoothie? It's mostly protein and confetti.","Win or lose, shake hands. Then shake smoothies."],"b":"[QUEST] WANDER the arena tunnel shadow-boxing; ♥ fav: DRK"}
